# tp4/next-2 window: this is tp4-kvread-next-jobs/A1R-parked-audit-region re-pointed at the integrated image tp4-next2-1 (B0 of this pack, built from the tp4/next-2 head = tp4/octo-2 + tp4/prod-fixes); where the text below
# says tp4/prod-fixes or the window branch read tp4/next-2, and the image tag placeholder is tp4-next2-1 (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt of this pack has the order and the minutes.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the region-read qualification pack (tp4-kvread-next-jobs, docs/prefix-audit-cost.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the window branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the cost.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env).
# A1R REPLACES A1 of the engine-reuse pack (tp4-engine-reuse-jobs/A1-parked-audit-attach): the audited PARKED arm, on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-kvr-parked-audit (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-parked-audit plus
# QWEN_FAST_LEVERN_KV_READ=region; named so, not '...-parked-audit-kvr', because make_octo_profiles and make_parked_profiles anchor on every name that starts '...-levern-parked'). The same tests as A0R: a rebound engine
# equals a cold one, compared by parked_compare.py against A0R's logs (every hash, every digest, every accepted-prefix sequence). Run only after A0R. READ: as A1 (docs/tp4-engine-reuse.md) plus a
# 'kv read mode=region ... fallback=-' line per digest and c2_smoke_check clean. Stop rule. Duration (estimate): 75 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-kvr-parked-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,parked_equal,parked_budgets,levern_equal,levern_equal_busy
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=audited attach arm (exactness tests): its test list is fixed by the pack protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
